          "text": "Do you eat quickly at your desk and walk fast everywhere? The 'slow living' movement says: stop! Its fans eat slowly, with family or friends. They cook carefully with fresh food. They switch off their phones in the evening and sleep well. 'Life isn't a race,' says one fan. 'When you live slowly, you notice beautiful things.'",
